{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.TransferMatrixOperator"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.ofHecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.ofHecke","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BreitWheelerPairProduction.lean#L55-L71","doc":"**De-axiomatisation (bean `h2yz`).** The bare-pair NF coefficients are not\nfree: they are the Hecke reduction of `σ₀·σ₀` computed by a\n`TransferMatrixOperator` `T` at the same `q`. `T.reduce_sigma_squared`\nproves `reduceA 1 0 1 0 = q − q⁻¹` and `reduceB 1 0 1 0 = 1`, so `γγ = σ₀²`\ngenuinely reduces to `(q−q⁻¹)σ₀ + 1` — the coefficients are derived, not\nasserted. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.net_gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.net_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BreitWheelerPairProduction.lean#L44-L53","doc":"In the QOU regime `q > 1` the bare pair carries net weight `> 1`\n(the `q`-deformation raises it above the classical value), since\n`q − q⁻¹ > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.net_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.net_def","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BreitWheelerPairProduction.lean#L40-L40","doc":"`net(γγ) = nfConst + nfSigma = 1 + (q − q⁻¹)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.nfConst_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.nfConst_def","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BreitWheelerPairProduction.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Constant coefficient is `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.nfSigma_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.nfSigma_def","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BreitWheelerPairProduction.lean#L36-L36","doc":"`σ₀`-coefficient is `q − q⁻¹` (from `σ₀² = (q−q⁻¹)σ₀ + 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.net","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.net","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BreitWheelerPairProduction.lean#L34-L34","doc":"The net weight of `γγ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.nfConst","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.nfConst","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BreitWheelerPairProduction.lean#L32-L32","doc":"The constant coefficient of `NF(σ₀²)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.nfSigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.nfSigma","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BreitWheelerPairProduction.lean#L30-L30","doc":"The `σ₀`-coefficient of `NF(σ₀²)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.hq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.hq","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BreitWheelerPairProduction.lean#L28-L28","doc":"QOU regime `q > 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.q","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BreitWheelerPairProduction.lean#L26-L26","doc":"Substrate parameter `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction.mk","kind":"ctor","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BreitWheelerPairProduction.lean#L24-L24","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BreitWheelerPairProduction","kind":"structure","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BreitWheelerPairProduction.lean#L19-L40","doc":"Data for the bare Breit–Wheeler photon pair `γγ = σ₀²`.\n\nA `definition` carrier: the substrate `q > 1`, the Hecke normal-form\ncoefficients of `σ₀²` (`σ₀`-part `q − q⁻¹`, constant `1`), and the net\nweight `net = 1 + (q − q⁻¹)`, the sum of the normal-form coefficients. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:breit-wheeler-pair-production","label":"def:breit-wheeler-pair-production","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/breit-wheeler-pair-production.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}